WEBVTT

00:30.930 --> 00:33.300
[You Have My Heart]

00:33.370 --> 00:36.270
[Episode 5: Fall into This World]

00:41.260 --> 00:41.700
My Lord.

00:45.820 --> 00:46.340
Constable Chen.

00:47.180 --> 00:47.670
My Lord,

00:47.980 --> 00:48.670
you're awake.

00:51.980 --> 00:53.310
Thanks to Lady Fufeng for saving you.

00:53.720 --> 00:55.330
You must have encountered
a possession demon.

00:55.980 --> 00:57.030
According to ancient records,

00:57.260 --> 00:58.030
this demon is formless.

00:58.150 --> 00:59.510
It can possess a human's body
and take his soul.

00:59.900 --> 01:01.260
The victims

01:01.360 --> 01:02.470
all took paper talismans.

01:02.540 --> 01:03.980
You took quite a lot yesterday.

01:04.819 --> 01:06.980
Didn't you say it is
an echo demon?

01:07.050 --> 01:08.460
Now you said it was a possession demon?

01:10.390 --> 01:13.160
Perhaps there was
no echo demon at all.

01:15.180 --> 01:16.820
People here speak with an accent.

01:16.950 --> 01:17.820
Possession demons. Possession demons.

01:17.820 --> 01:19.510
It just turned into echo demons
through word of mouth.

01:20.100 --> 01:22.260
Everything in the world leaves a trace.

01:22.430 --> 01:23.700
Whether it's an echo demon

01:23.820 --> 01:24.820
or a possession demon,

01:25.150 --> 01:26.060
it was just a trick used by the killer

01:26.510 --> 01:28.060
to cover up his crimes.

01:28.510 --> 01:29.670
Young Magistrate.

01:30.460 --> 01:32.430
You've investigated
the echo demon for so long,

01:32.539 --> 01:34.180
but you really don't believe it at all.

01:35.750 --> 01:36.750
Whatever happens in Yin-Yang Crossing

01:37.060 --> 01:37.870
has nothing to do with me.

01:38.229 --> 01:39.030
Once I finish investigating this case,

01:39.750 --> 01:40.539
I will leave immediately.

01:43.750 --> 01:44.220
Master.

01:45.270 --> 01:47.500
You shouldn't have used
so much spiritual power yesterday

01:47.500 --> 01:48.500
to fight against Bai Han.

01:49.940 --> 01:52.220
The seal of Kuquan Valley
has been unstable recently.

01:52.940 --> 01:53.310
You...

01:53.620 --> 01:54.460
I must stop it.

01:55.900 --> 01:56.710
This time,

01:57.460 --> 01:58.990
it targets my tree heart.

02:00.380 --> 02:01.180
But

02:01.830 --> 02:03.430
that heart doesn't recognize you yet.

02:04.270 --> 02:07.030
The spiritual spring is drying up
day by day. As one falls, another rises.

02:07.940 --> 02:09.110
How should we deal with it?

02:09.620 --> 02:10.750
Just by fighting head-on,

02:11.430 --> 02:12.710
I won't last long.

02:13.590 --> 02:15.710
Now there is only one last way left.

02:17.150 --> 02:18.940
Make its current master

02:19.370 --> 02:21.400
recognize me, obey me,

02:21.890 --> 02:23.610
and truly become my man.

02:24.180 --> 02:26.110
And then, I will let him

02:26.320 --> 02:28.690
offer himself,

02:29.370 --> 02:30.650
along with that heart, to me willingly.

02:36.060 --> 02:37.220
There's corruption

02:37.740 --> 02:38.930
moving on Nanqiutou Road.

02:40.220 --> 02:41.590
It's the Sun's Bakery.

02:43.310 --> 02:45.100
[Sun's Bakery]

02:46.829 --> 02:47.710
It's weird.

02:48.560 --> 02:49.730
It's noon.

02:49.760 --> 02:50.829
Why aren't they doing business?

02:52.030 --> 02:53.110
I told you,

02:53.310 --> 02:55.750
the mystery lies in this bakery shop.

02:58.680 --> 02:59.520
What's that smell?

03:01.610 --> 03:02.450
Is anyone inside?

03:02.480 --> 03:03.640
-Open the door!
-Is it on fire?

03:05.330 --> 03:06.080
There is something wrong.

03:06.110 --> 03:07.390
This smell is a bit strange.

03:07.680 --> 03:09.050
It doesn't smell like normal firewood.

03:09.300 --> 03:10.530
Something must have happened inside.

03:20.950 --> 03:21.750
Don't touch it.

03:31.100 --> 03:31.870
Your hand...

03:32.370 --> 03:33.180
I'm fine.

03:35.260 --> 03:36.420
The old man ran away.

03:36.710 --> 03:37.590
Lady Fufeng,

03:37.720 --> 03:39.910
it seems that the paper was just lit.

03:40.360 --> 03:41.850
Did this paper catch fire on its own?

03:42.160 --> 03:44.640
Why is there white smoke and black fire?

03:44.660 --> 03:45.870
It's weird.

03:46.640 --> 03:47.670
It's not spontaneous combustion.

03:48.260 --> 03:49.230
It's purification.

03:50.360 --> 03:52.040
The evil entity attached to the paper

03:52.079 --> 03:53.670
knew it couldn't hide anymore,

03:53.829 --> 03:55.350
so it destroyed the evidence.

03:59.579 --> 04:00.790
They are completely burned.

04:02.990 --> 04:04.500
It's the corruption!

04:07.260 --> 04:08.060
Gentlemen,

04:08.540 --> 04:10.810
what are you doing in my shop?

04:12.500 --> 04:13.260
Who are you?

04:13.330 --> 04:15.060
I am the owner of this bakery shop.

04:18.120 --> 04:18.880
This...

04:19.140 --> 04:20.550
What happened to this cabinet?

04:20.940 --> 04:22.910
I only closed my shop for a few days

04:22.930 --> 04:23.970
and just got back.

04:24.000 --> 04:25.440
Was I robbed?

04:26.940 --> 04:30.500
Where is the one-eyed old man
who was here before?

04:30.790 --> 04:31.470
Sir,

04:31.470 --> 04:32.840
are you mistaken?

04:32.860 --> 04:34.740
I am the only one who runs this shop.

04:35.270 --> 04:37.710
I caught a cold a few days ago
and took some time off.

04:37.870 --> 04:39.400
I was just about to open.

04:40.670 --> 04:42.320
You said you're the only one?

04:42.590 --> 04:43.380
Yes.

04:43.409 --> 04:44.140
Impossible.

04:44.390 --> 04:45.590
A few days ago, we...

04:45.610 --> 04:46.310
Hu.

04:47.550 --> 04:48.720
Do you recognize this?

04:51.620 --> 04:52.430
This...

04:53.840 --> 04:54.840
No, I don't.

05:46.310 --> 05:47.140
My Lady.

05:48.670 --> 05:50.350
Speak your mind, Lord Bai.

05:52.060 --> 05:52.870
My Lady.

05:53.600 --> 05:55.480
I've checked the neighbors,

05:55.710 --> 05:57.270
household registers, and travel passes.

05:58.670 --> 06:00.760
No one knows this one-eyed old man.

06:01.250 --> 06:02.060
So?

06:02.660 --> 06:04.730
Please enlighten me, My Lady.

06:13.930 --> 06:16.740
You're truly adaptable, Lord Bai.

06:18.500 --> 06:19.430
Then let me tell you.

06:19.910 --> 06:20.910
The person you are looking for

06:22.230 --> 06:23.550
doesn't exist at all.

06:24.360 --> 06:25.310
If so,

06:26.020 --> 06:28.290
we can only collect clues from the people.

06:29.690 --> 06:30.490
My Lady,

06:30.520 --> 06:31.880
this is the notice I drafted.

06:32.350 --> 06:34.580
I plan to post it tomorrow
to offer a reward for clues.

06:35.020 --> 06:35.820
Open it.

06:36.180 --> 06:38.130
[Notice]

06:39.990 --> 06:42.520
Stating the facts objectively

06:43.470 --> 06:45.060
won't help with getting clues.

06:45.430 --> 06:47.990
It will only cause citywide panic.

06:48.580 --> 06:49.190
But...

06:49.880 --> 06:51.610
But if we hide it from the people,

06:51.800 --> 06:54.070
they are more likely to be in danger.

06:59.230 --> 06:59.870
Pen.

07:23.260 --> 07:24.550
Here in Yin-Yang Crossing,

07:25.430 --> 07:26.460
my name

07:26.760 --> 07:28.360
is more useful than your official seal.

07:31.080 --> 07:34.500
[Liu Fufeng]

07:49.050 --> 07:50.700
Just wear it.

07:52.030 --> 07:52.830
It seems

07:53.050 --> 07:54.580
you believe it a bit too.

08:02.540 --> 08:03.220
My Lady.

08:04.310 --> 08:06.900
You'd better apply some medicine
to this burn.

08:08.820 --> 08:09.910
It's just a scratch.

08:10.240 --> 08:11.770
No need to worry, Lord Bai.

08:12.840 --> 08:15.270
I'm better than someone
overestimating himself

08:15.470 --> 08:18.630
and nearly getting killed.

08:19.130 --> 08:19.940
My Lady,

08:20.120 --> 08:22.270
why do you worry about me suddenly?

08:26.750 --> 08:28.540
Because I want you to stay

08:28.930 --> 08:30.120
and be my man.

08:34.080 --> 08:36.600
My man ran into trouble
while handling a case outside.

08:37.140 --> 08:38.450
Wasn't it perfectly justified

08:38.679 --> 08:40.230
for me to step in and solve it?

08:43.539 --> 08:44.370
My Lady.

08:45.480 --> 08:47.640
I... I am not your man.

09:06.410 --> 09:07.260
Why are you still here?

09:09.360 --> 09:10.960
I'm going to change and rest.

09:15.790 --> 09:16.760
Thank you, My Lady.

09:20.430 --> 09:22.710
I want you to be my man

09:23.160 --> 09:26.330
and willingly offer your heart to me.

09:36.910 --> 09:38.550
Master, this is the place.

09:39.470 --> 09:41.140
This abandoned ancient well is

09:41.270 --> 09:43.440
a rift we sealed years ago.

09:43.760 --> 09:46.000
Someone broke a corner of the seal.

09:46.830 --> 09:47.800
Fortunately,

09:47.830 --> 09:48.950
the leak is small.

09:48.970 --> 09:50.450
The corruption hasn't spread.

09:51.270 --> 09:52.120
It was man-made.

09:53.900 --> 09:55.020
The traces are fresh,

09:55.090 --> 09:56.450
but they were highly skilled.

09:56.480 --> 09:57.640
I can't find any clues.

09:57.840 --> 10:00.120
I have sent people to reinforce the seal.

10:00.470 --> 10:02.720
We've cleaned
the escaping corruption around.

10:04.310 --> 10:05.080
But

10:06.590 --> 10:07.990
I am afraid that some people and spirits

10:08.260 --> 10:09.590
might have been affected by corruption.

10:09.710 --> 10:10.870
We need to find them as soon as possible.

10:11.190 --> 10:11.950
Otherwise,

10:12.230 --> 10:13.420
Yin-Yang Crossing

10:14.260 --> 10:15.590
will really be in chaos.

10:33.110 --> 10:33.870
Master.

10:34.220 --> 10:35.460
The residual corruption

10:35.630 --> 10:36.680
disappears here.

10:37.970 --> 10:40.120
Seems like it was stirred by something

10:40.800 --> 10:41.960
and then covered up.

10:44.090 --> 10:46.460
[Huichun Brothel]

10:49.930 --> 10:51.050
She is fickle.

10:51.960 --> 10:53.430
Originally, she wanted to kill me
and cut out my heart.

10:53.570 --> 10:54.930
But then, she asked me to
investigate the case.

10:55.840 --> 10:58.910
Now, she wanted me to stay

10:59.990 --> 11:02.500
and become her man.

11:15.330 --> 11:16.090
My Lady,

11:16.270 --> 11:18.550
why do you worry about me suddenly?

11:19.100 --> 11:20.860
Because I want you to stay

11:21.020 --> 11:22.300
and be my man.

11:29.720 --> 11:30.920
She must have an ulterior motive.

11:35.980 --> 11:36.770
My Lord.

11:37.890 --> 11:39.200
Something happened at Huichun Brothel.

11:39.250 --> 11:40.340
Should we go and take a look?

11:41.310 --> 11:42.080
Huichun Brothel?

12:01.490 --> 12:02.090
Master.

12:02.540 --> 12:03.750
Though the state of death is terrifying,

12:03.930 --> 12:06.430
the body hasn't been corrupted.

12:09.330 --> 12:10.640
Let mortals handle

12:11.770 --> 12:13.280
mortal cases.

12:13.750 --> 12:14.710
Someone died!

12:14.870 --> 12:16.110
Someone died! Someone died!

12:16.110 --> 12:17.470
Someone died! Let's go! Let's go!

12:18.980 --> 12:19.900
Lord Bai,

12:20.030 --> 12:22.360
don't cause trouble at a time like this.

12:23.440 --> 12:24.390
What do you mean?

12:24.820 --> 12:26.150
Lady Fufeng is investigating the case.

12:26.170 --> 12:27.880
If you rush in, offend Lady Fufeng,

12:27.900 --> 12:29.450
and then alert that thing,

12:29.480 --> 12:30.480
who's going to take responsibility?

12:30.740 --> 12:31.980
Watch your mouth.

12:32.560 --> 12:33.370
My Lord,

12:33.400 --> 12:35.070
we do trust you.

12:35.240 --> 12:37.440
But Yin-Yang Crossing

12:37.600 --> 12:39.760
has never had so much trouble.

12:40.900 --> 12:41.750
Fine.

12:42.420 --> 12:43.780
Since Lady Fufeng is here,

12:44.060 --> 12:45.150
I won't interfere.

12:46.600 --> 12:48.110
Lord Bai is my man.

12:48.870 --> 12:49.910
Let him in.

12:56.380 --> 12:56.980
Go.

13:09.900 --> 13:10.810
Lady Fufeng.

13:12.740 --> 13:14.740
Rest assured, Lord Bai.

13:17.490 --> 13:18.560
It hasn't been moved.

13:23.050 --> 13:24.500
The people don't trust you,

13:24.690 --> 13:26.050
but I do.

13:26.870 --> 13:27.870
I believe

13:28.090 --> 13:30.160
you can find out the truth.

13:31.370 --> 13:32.800
So, I am here

13:33.660 --> 13:34.660
waiting for you.

13:53.780 --> 13:55.530
The victim is female,

13:55.870 --> 13:57.260
about 25 or 26 years old.

14:21.530 --> 14:23.740
Her face was slashed multiple times,

14:23.890 --> 14:25.250
but these wounds are not fatal.

14:31.080 --> 14:32.630
There are signs of suspected poisoning.

14:47.860 --> 14:50.290
This item is crucial evidence.

14:57.560 --> 15:00.280
Thank you just now, Lady Fufeng.

15:02.660 --> 15:03.500
Thank you?

15:06.830 --> 15:08.640
I was just managing my territory

15:09.040 --> 15:10.440
and protecting my man.

15:14.310 --> 15:15.680
What do you need to thank me for?

15:19.140 --> 15:20.140
Lady Fufeng,

15:20.830 --> 15:23.190
I am an imperially appointed
seventh-rank magistrate.

15:24.900 --> 15:26.900
The court entitled me

15:27.140 --> 15:28.380
and gave me my salary.

15:28.710 --> 15:29.750
I'm not...

15:32.380 --> 15:34.630
I'm not anyone else's man.

15:39.730 --> 15:41.580
You say you're not my man

15:42.590 --> 15:44.220
while using my power

15:44.710 --> 15:46.280
frequently.

15:47.710 --> 15:48.980
Are you

15:49.750 --> 15:51.510
refuting me,

15:53.170 --> 15:55.130
or deceiving yourself?

15:57.900 --> 15:58.990
Lady Fufeng.

15:59.580 --> 16:01.580
If you want to take everything back,

16:01.700 --> 16:04.130
I will have no complaints.

16:06.560 --> 16:07.530
Lord Bai,

16:07.990 --> 16:10.750
you've already tasted the power.

16:11.040 --> 16:13.920
Why lie to yourself
and say it's not sweet?

16:16.210 --> 16:17.050
It's nothing but

16:17.850 --> 16:19.610
sugar-coated poison.

16:20.720 --> 16:22.390
Every favor

16:22.590 --> 16:23.950
comes with a price.

16:27.820 --> 16:30.060
Lady Fufeng, just tell me

16:31.070 --> 16:33.900
exactly what you want from me.

16:46.230 --> 16:47.300
Lady Fufeng.

16:49.390 --> 16:50.470
Lady Fufeng,

16:50.960 --> 16:52.680
please find out the truth

16:52.840 --> 16:54.420
to redress the injustice for Wan.

16:54.870 --> 16:56.080
Wan

16:56.110 --> 16:57.480
was a servant,

16:57.670 --> 16:59.320
but she had a gentle temper.

16:59.910 --> 17:02.080
Mingyuan has a bad temper,

17:02.340 --> 17:04.339
but she wouldn't go as far as
to kill someone.

17:04.520 --> 17:06.280
There must be some misunderstanding.

17:07.300 --> 17:08.060
Yes.

17:08.190 --> 17:09.950
It must be a thief from outside.

17:10.950 --> 17:13.069
What rumors have you heard in town?

17:13.750 --> 17:15.190
Just tell us the rumors you've heard,

17:15.400 --> 17:16.400
no matter how absurd they are.

17:18.510 --> 17:21.470
Those are just gossip,

17:21.640 --> 17:22.839
which can't be taken seriously.

17:24.569 --> 17:26.050
Gossip

17:27.390 --> 17:29.580
often hides some truths.

17:30.320 --> 17:31.040
Tell me.

17:32.910 --> 17:33.910
Some people said that

17:34.750 --> 17:35.800
Wan was killed because of a love affair.

17:38.910 --> 17:41.430
They said that
Wan had been favored lately

17:41.960 --> 17:44.440
and caught the eye of
a frequent guest of Mingyuan's,

17:44.800 --> 17:46.760
Mr. Du.

17:46.870 --> 17:48.220
He promised that he would

17:48.490 --> 17:50.140
take Wan out of this misery.

17:50.840 --> 17:52.840
When Mingyuan found out, she...

17:58.740 --> 17:59.900
Others said

18:01.050 --> 18:02.050
it was to silence her.

18:03.420 --> 18:04.630
Over the years,

18:04.770 --> 18:06.690
to keep her top position,

18:07.020 --> 18:09.500
Mingyuan privately used some shady methods

18:09.500 --> 18:10.750
to maintain her looks.

18:11.310 --> 18:14.070
Wan accidentally caught her.

18:17.110 --> 18:18.830
Wan was so honest

18:19.320 --> 18:20.670
that she probably advised Mingyuan a bit.

18:20.690 --> 18:21.580
Then, Mingyuan killed...

18:25.950 --> 18:26.790
What else?

18:27.270 --> 18:29.030
Is there anything related to
Mingyuan herself?

18:31.820 --> 18:32.950
Well.

18:35.990 --> 18:37.190
Well, it's said that

18:37.860 --> 18:39.380
as Mingyuan grows older,

18:39.860 --> 18:41.470
her appearance is not
as good as it used to be.

18:41.490 --> 18:43.060
She gets fewer guests.

18:43.860 --> 18:46.950
Seeing Wan become more beautiful
day by day,

18:47.130 --> 18:49.300
Mingyuan was afraid Wan would
take her place as the top courtesan.

18:49.600 --> 18:50.120
So...

18:50.860 --> 18:52.300
So, Mingyuan made up her mind

18:52.360 --> 18:53.520
to ruin Wan's face

18:54.160 --> 18:55.290
and kill her.

19:05.100 --> 19:06.820
That's her. Search.

19:08.060 --> 19:09.650
We should find Mingyuan, the suspect,

19:09.840 --> 19:11.970
at any cost.

19:12.260 --> 19:13.190
Yes.

19:38.590 --> 19:40.340
Mingyuan, suspect in the Huichun Brothel
murder case,

19:40.750 --> 19:42.160
I am ordered to arrest you.

19:42.370 --> 19:43.170
Escort her back to the county yamen

19:43.190 --> 19:44.360
and hand her over to Lord Bai.

19:44.740 --> 19:45.660
Let me go.

19:46.160 --> 19:47.230
I didn't kill anyone.

19:47.280 --> 19:48.150
I didn't.

19:48.520 --> 19:49.240
Let me go.

19:49.270 --> 19:50.140
I didn't.

20:00.510 --> 20:04.710
Run! Run! Run!

20:05.780 --> 20:07.020
I didn't kill anyone.

20:10.020 --> 20:10.910
So handsome.

20:11.840 --> 20:13.260
It's true, My Lord.

20:13.290 --> 20:15.290
All the people on the street saw it.

20:15.310 --> 20:16.960
Her face was like water,

20:16.990 --> 20:18.470
and it instantly turned into mine.

20:18.540 --> 20:19.660
Luckily, I'm a handsome man,

20:19.680 --> 20:20.720
which avoided a panic.

20:20.750 --> 20:22.710
Otherwise, it would have caused trouble.

20:22.910 --> 20:23.750
I think

20:23.770 --> 20:25.620
you've lost your mind
investigating the case.

20:26.060 --> 20:27.410
I might have mistaken it.

20:27.440 --> 20:28.160
But did all the people on the street

20:28.180 --> 20:29.500
get possessed?

20:29.530 --> 20:30.360
Enough.

20:30.550 --> 20:31.340
Open the door.

20:43.990 --> 20:45.230
You know how to change your face.

20:45.260 --> 20:46.330
Show Lord Bai.

20:51.910 --> 20:52.910
She can change her face.

20:53.720 --> 20:54.850
Aren't you capable?

20:55.470 --> 20:57.190
Hurry up and show Lord Bai.

20:58.010 --> 20:59.360
All right, that's enough.

21:05.780 --> 21:06.650
Mingyuan.

21:07.230 --> 21:07.990
Let me ask you.

21:08.340 --> 21:10.230
Why did you kill the servant girl Wan

21:10.310 --> 21:11.740
and disfigure her?

21:11.880 --> 21:13.010
Confess everything.

21:21.170 --> 21:22.690
Did she say anything?

23:20.960 --> 23:21.890
Lord Bai,

23:22.770 --> 23:23.900
welcome to

23:24.410 --> 23:25.930
the real Yin-Yang Crossing.
